# path<TAB>symbol<TAB>reason; format and reason prefixes in scripts/gates/seed-literals.py
samples/lifecourse/src/commands.rs	PREREGISTERED_SEED	world: the seed the preregistration names for its comparisons
samples/lifecourse/src/report.rs	SEEDS_REPORTED	world: a count of seeds reported, not a seed
samples/lifecourse/src/report.rs	PREREGISTERED_BOOTSTRAP_SEED	world: the bootstrap seed the preregistration names for its intervals; a report passes it to reproduce them and otherwise draws its own
